{"unit_id":"EventHorizonXT__dsh-model-navigator#feature-1","repo":"EventHorizonXT/dsh-model-navigator","commit":"019f0ef26b8320800d00f62acf30c214aa6973a6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Navigator 的功能「跨供应商模型搜索」：输入模型名、别名或供应商关键词即可搜索并按匹配度排序。用户在模型选择面板输入查询，结果来自已有目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/core/search.mjs:20-35","src/core/search.mjs:58-81"]}
{"unit_id":"EventHorizonXT__dsh-model-navigator#feature-2","repo":"EventHorizonXT/dsh-model-navigator","commit":"019f0ef26b8320800d00f62acf30c214aa6973a6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Model Navigator 的功能「收藏与最近模型」：在模型选择界面收藏模型，并查看最近选择的模型。选择后最近列表去重并更新顺序，偏好保存在本地存储可用时跨会话保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/core/preferences.mjs:20-37","src/core/preferences.mjs:116-124","lib/client.js:2305-2309"]}
